{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1992d596-49d7-869c-9786-171ed6b4c2f2",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T12:02:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T11:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T11:58:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I am calling about my trash pickup. The truck, it damaged my bin this morning, and also I think this is the second miss in a row for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T11:59:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Let's take it one at a time. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T11:59:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 361 Ruggles Avenue. On Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T11:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three sixty-one Ruggles. Got it. And when you say second miss, what do you mean, they didn't pick up at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T11:59:30-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Last week they did not take anything. Now this week they come, I think, because the bin is damaged, but the trash is still inside. Half of it. Then they leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T11:59:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So they may have grabbed it, cracked it, and then dropped the load or skipped it. Is that what you're seeing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T11:59:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. The lid is broken, and one side is cracked. I can see it from my window. I have a telescope there, I am a stargazer, so it is pointed out the window, and in the morning I was looking at the street and I saw the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, so you actually watched it happen. That's helpful. Did the crew leave any tag or notice on the bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:00:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No tag. Nothing. Only the broken bin on the curb, and the bag fell on the side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it the city-issued bin, the big one with the wheels?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, with the wheels. One wheel also is loose. Sorry, what does it mean, a work order? You said it before I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:00:43-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I haven't said it yet, but that's what I'm going to do. A work order is just a written request that goes to the crew supervisor, so someone is assigned to fix or replace the bin and to look at the missed pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So you write it, and then somebody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:01:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I'll put down the damaged bin, the broken lid, the loose wheel, and that this is two missed collections in a row. Is the trash still sitting out there now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:01:18-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is still there. I put the bin back near the fence, but it is open. I do not want animals."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:01:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. If you can, bag it tight and keep it by the bin. I'll note that it needs a return pickup. I can't promise the exact hour, since the holiday week has things backed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:01:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, the holiday. I understand. Yesterday was a holiday, so maybe that is why last week and this week are a little crazy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:01:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be part of it. Christmas week schedules slide, but a damaged bin is on us either way. Can I get a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0193."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one nine three. Perfect. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rosemarie DeLuca. D-e, capital L-u-c-a."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Rosemarie. Okay, I've got the request in. Someone should contact you or replace the bin, and I've flagged the missed pickup so it gets looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And if nobody comes by Monday, I call again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call back and mention today's date, and we'll follow up on the same request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is all I need. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good rest of your Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T12:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
